      "pairs": [
        {
          "name": "chat invoice card",
          "design": "[data-spot=\"invCard\"]",
          "app": "[data-spot=\"invCard\"]",
          "check": [
            "w",
            "h"
          ],
          "animations": false,
          "why": "Size only: the export lays its canvas out at 44/248 inside the mock page, and the stage is 1380x860 against the design's 1440x900 canvas, so absolute x/y are offset on both axes. x is identical once the 44px page margin is removed (504) and y is identical measured from the stage's bottom edge (card bottom 100 above it in both)."
        },
        {
          "name": "card toggle",
          "design": "[data-spot=\"toggle\"]",
          "app": "[data-spot=\"toggle\"]",
          "check": [
            "w",
            "h"
          ],
          "animations": false,
          "why": "Same offset as the card; measured x 660 and h 28 match exactly."
        },
        {
          "name": "line price",
          "design": "[data-spot=\"tplPrice\"]",
          "app": "[data-spot=\"tplPrice\"]",
          "check": [
            "h"
          ],
          "animations": false,
          "why": "Height only: the pill is content-sized and the two players are sampled at different beats (the export has typed $400.00 = 88px by the time the app case finishes its 9s wait, whose scene 0 is still on the empty $Price = 76px). Both are 34 high, and with the same text both measure 88 (checked on the Clients tour's Save your jobs beat)."
        },
        {
